<h2 class="ds-section-title">What a bottega is</h2>

<div class="about-prose">
  <p>
    Club Matto started in Berlin as a collective of freelancers. The name is a wordplay on Club-Mate, the drink you find
    in every Berlin fridge, and on <em>matto</em>, the Italian word for crazy. It became something smaller and more
    deliberate: a bottega, the workshop where an artisan makes one thing at a time, by hand.
  </p>
  <p>
    In practice, that means we keep the company small enough that the people who design a tool also build it, ship it,
    and answer the email when it breaks. No meetings, no platform team, no roadmap written by someone who has not read
    the code.
  </p>
</div>

